# English only

This repository is English-only. Write **all** project-facing text in English — no exceptions.

## Applies to

- Documentation (`README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, comments in markdown)
- Source code comments and docstrings
- CSS comments in drafts/build files
- Commit messages and PR descriptions
- Error messages, CLI output, and log strings
- Variable names, function names, and user-facing strings in scripts
- GitHub Issues, Releases, and workflow descriptions

## Rules

1. Do not add Italian (or any other language) in repo files, even in brief notes or examples.
2. When editing existing non-English text, translate it to English.
3. Chat with the maintainer may be in another language; **files committed to the repo must still be English**.

## Examples

```markdown
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
`cd` non serve se sei già nella root del repo.

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
No `cd` is needed if you are already in the repository root.
```

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
/* Spaziatura verticale per le card */

/* ✅ GOOD */
/* Vertical spacing for cards */
```

```javascript
// ❌ BAD
console.error('Build fallito');

// ✅ GOOD
console.error('Build failed');
```
